                <h3 class="postingHeader">Job Description and Duties</h3>
                <p class="postingContent">
                    <img src="https://www.dsh.ca.gov/BrandingImages/coalinga_header.png" style="max-height: 50%; width: 100%; object-fit: contain" alt="alt text" />

<span style="line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>This position is located at Coalinga State Hospital.</strong>&nbsp;<br /><br />The Psychologist applies psychological knowledge and techniques to the assessment and treatment of
forensic patients, mostly sexual offenders detained or committed pursuant to
California Sexually Violent Predator (SVP) Act; conduct wide range of
psychological assessments; facilitate psychotherapy groups and individual
therapy; construct case formulations; develop and implement treatment plans;
lead multidisciplinary treatment team conferences; write progress reports;
assist in developing training programs for other staff; and serve as
consultants.<br /></span><span style="text-indent: 0px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="line-height: 15.33px; font-size: 12pt;"><br /></span></span><span style="text-align: justify; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Ability to provide accurate and complete reports and documentation in accordance with professional standards, hospital documentation polices, and State guidelines.<br /></span><span style="text-indent: 0px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="line-height: 15.33px; font-size: 12pt;"><br /></span></span><span style="text-align: justify; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Ability to provide psychological assessments that are completed timely and address the required specificity of content.<br /><br /><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">**For more information regarding the duties for this particular&nbsp;classification, please refer to the Duty Statement attached to this bulletin**<br /> </span></strong></span></span></span></span><p style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 12pt; text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;"><span style="background-color: #ffffff;">Click on the link to complete the Department of State Hospitals Recruitment Survey:&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><a href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdsh.sjc1.qualtrics.com%2Fjfe%2Fform%2FSV_9TCuZ0vceU3DEOi&amp;data=05%7C02%7CJustine.Oxborrow%40dsh.ca.gov%7Cb1635845a98b457347a908dc032b4538%7C807536a6a6b14893a01370509c59ebbb%7C0%7C0%7C638388731606083825%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=ZHItucbI%2B9B9emNS6P7SW%2Bwkd%2BBwhRpmxsQQ%2F1FkFbM%3D&amp;reserved=0" style="text-decoration-line: none;"><span style="color: #0563c1; font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; text-decor